 "notes": [
  "Qty 59 as published: the Characters header says 18 but 17 are listed (12 named characters plus AT-ST Pilot x5).",
  "The strategy calls this 'my version of my friend Martin Akesson's Raltiir-deck' with Wahlgren's own changes; credited to Wahlgren.",
  "Posted 'Darth Vader's Lightsaber' dested the Premiere Vader's Lightsaber (the Death Star II card Darth Vader's Lightsaber was not yet released in January 2000).",
  "Posted 'Raltiir' dested Ralltiir; 'Forrest' the generic Forest site; 'Medtitation Chamber' Executor: Meditation Chamber; 'Omni Box' Ommni Box; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Lieutennant ...' the Lieutenant cards; 'There Be Hell To Pay' There'll Be Hell To Pay. Battle Order is the older Effect (no Defensive Shields existed in early 2000)."
